#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Wall Power Law Regression Analysis with Full Statistical Output

Description:
    This script performs power law regression analysis (EDP = a * IM^b) on
    wall displacement data and intensity measure data. It fits the model via
    OLS on log-log transformed data and outputs coefficients, R² (log and
    original), dispersion, standard errors, confidence intervals, t-statistics,
    and p-values. It includes JSON configuration persistence, R² heatmaps,
    dispersion (σ) heatmaps, and comparative plots per intensity measure.

    Input files must be named Z1.xlsx, Z2.xlsx, ... Zn.xlsx in both the
    displacement and IM folders. The user specifies the per-wall column
    letter for displacement values.
"""

